  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>With a flick of the wrist you repair your damaged weapon with a thin layer of akasha.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Con 13 or veilweaver level 1, proficient with at least one firearm, ability to bind veils to your Hands slot.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use a swift action to remove the broken condition from a single firearm you are currently wielding, as long as that condition was gained by a firearm misfire. This is not a permanent fix, as you have merely reinforced the weapon with a weak akashic veil. An additional misfire will shatter the akashic bonds, returning the weapon to the broken condition.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc38\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
